.TH "GF-ADMIN-USERS-ADMIN-CREATE-USER" "1" "May 2026" "" ""

.SH NAME
gf-admin-users-admin-create-user - Creates new user


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf admin-users admin-create-user [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates new user

.PP
If you are running Grafana Enterprise and have Fine-grained access control enabled, you need to have a permission with action \fBusers:create\fR\&. Note that OrgId is an optional parameter that can be used to assign a new user to a different organization when \fBauto_assign_org\fR is set to \fBtrue\fR\&.

.PP
Body schema (AdminCreateUserForm):
  email     string
  login     string
  name      string
  orgId     number
  password  string

.PP
Response schema (AdminCreateUserOK.Payload):
  id       number
  message  string
  uid      string


